.DS_Store
# Run artifacts are disposable — except the wardens' bench, which is design
# content the Forge serves as standing offers. `runs/*` (not `runs/`) so the
# negation below can reach inside; git cannot re-include through an ignored
# parent directory.
runs/*
!runs/endorsed/
# The listener's reports are design content too — the factory's output is
# worth keeping; its bulky inputs (audio, packets) stay in runs/witness/,
# which remains disposable like the rest.
!runs/feedback/

# Browser-pane render artifacts
.clearance-rendered-preview-*/
